Important Edge Cases 
•	Student attendance below the configured threshold. 
•	Correction requests for previous attendance. 
•	Correction request being approved or rejected. 
•	Invalid or missing attendance data. 
•	Searching for a student who does not exist. 
•	No attendance records available for a particular student/subject. 
•	Multiple attendance updates for the same session. 
•	Server/storage errors while reading or writing application data. 
 
 
